  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.desc.2": "两翼相携，方能同赴一线。",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.1": "圣光矢触发概率|%s%%",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.2": "圣光矢伤害|触发之箭伤害的 %s%%",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.3": "圣光矢从眼位朝准心射出：速度等同满蓄力箭矢、无重力，可无限穿透生物，但会被方块挡下",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.4": "与「新约」同戴时：任一效果触发都会带出另一个（延迟 %s 秒）",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.5": "两次判定都成功时：圣光矢 +%s 道、新约落箭 +1 支",
  "item.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.paired_wings.shift.6": "圣光矢与落箭同为真实伤害：无视护甲、保护附魔、抗性与无敌帧；圣光矢不造成击退",

  "death.attack.summy-reliquary-apocrypha.new_testament_arrow": "%1$s 被落下的箭矢贯穿",
